note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note Attention-family launch records: address pairs followed by scalar words.
fn av_pack p view ulong 32 a edit uint 32 na ulong nw ulong to ulong
if or gt na 16 or gt nw 32 gt mul na 2 nw
ret 1
end
for i ulong 32
put a i uint 0
end
for i ulong na
v = get p i
put a mul i 2 uint and v 4294967295
put a add mul i 2 1 uint shr v 32
end
for i ulong sub nw mul na 2
v = get p add na i
v = and v 4294967295
put a add mul na 2 i uint v
end
ret 0
end

